An ambiguous first marker keeps its own dialect

```
i. x
b. y
.
<ol type="i">
  <li>x</li>
</ol>
<ol type="a" start="2">
  <li>y</li>
</ol>
```

```
v. x
ii. y
.
<ol type="a" start="22">
  <li>x</li>
</ol>
<ol type="i" start="2">
  <li>y</li>
</ol>
```

```
I. x
A. y
B. z
.
<ol type="I">
  <li>x</li>
</ol>
<ol type="A">
  <li>y</li>
  <li>z</li>
</ol>
```
